{% extends 'pghpoets/base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Criteria &middot; Pittsburgh Poets{% endblock %}

{# DRAFT: Greg, these criteria are a starting point. Log every change below. #}

{% block body %}
<h1>Inclusion criteria</h1>

<p><b>Version 0.1</b>, 12 November 2026.</p>

<p>A poet is included when at least one documented tie connects them to
Pittsburgh. "Pittsburgh" means the city within its present limits, which
include places that were separate when the poet was there, such as Allegheny
City (annexed in 1907). Every tie must cite a source.</p>

<h2>Kinds of tie</h2>

<table>
  <tr><th>Kind</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.born }}</td><td>Born in the city.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.raised }}</td><td>Spent some or all of childhood here.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.studied }}</td><td>Enrolled at a school or university here.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.lived }}</td><td>Lived here as an adult.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.worked }}</td><td>Held a job here, in any field.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.taught }}</td><td>Taught at a school or university here.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.published }}</td><td>Published a book with a Pittsburgh press.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>{{ kinds.edited }}</td><td>Edited a Pittsburgh press, series or journal.</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Status</h2>

<dl>
  <dt><b>{{ inclusion.core }}</b></dt>
  <dd>The ties are substantial: years of residence, study or work.</dd>
  <dt><b>{{ inclusion.edge }}</b></dt>
  <dd>The ties are real but slight, such as birth followed by an early move.
      These entries stay in the catalog because they test the category.</dd>
</dl>

<h2>Not yet decided</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Whether the metro area counts, or only the city.</li>
  <li>Whether a visiting reading or a short residency counts as a tie.</li>
  <li>Whether to include writers known mainly for other genres who also wrote poems.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Change log</h2>

<ul>
  <li><b>0.1</b> (12 November 2026): First draft.</li>
</ul>
{% endblock %}
